# Third-party notices

## DNG technology

This product includes DNG technology under license by Adobe.

Orion implements parts of Adobe's *Digital Negative (DNG) Specification*
(version 1.6.0.0, December 2021) from its published description — the
BaselineExposure zero point (tag 50730) and the HueSatMap profile stage
(tags 50938/50939, ProfileHueSatMapDims/Data/Encoding). The specification
carries a royalty-free patent grant, and that grant requires this notice to
appear prominently in source and documentation.

**No Adobe data is included.** Orion ships no `.dcp` profile from Adobe or from
any project that derives from one. Both values Orion uses are *fitted*, from
the camera's own JPEG and a second independent rendering of the same frame —
the method and the numbers are in `research/camera-profiles.md`. See
`planning/DECISIONS.md` #44 for why redistributing Adobe's profiles is out, and
#45 for an open question about the provenance of LibRaw's built-in matrices.

## LibRaw

Raw decoding uses LibRaw, dual-licensed LGPL-2.1 and CDDL-1.0. Orion links it
dynamically. See `planning/DECISIONS.md` #43.

## OpenCV

Bracket alignment for the HDR merge uses OpenCV (5.x), licensed under the
**Apache License 2.0**. Orion links it dynamically and confines it to one
translation unit (`engine/src/merge/Align.cpp`): ORB feature detection,
Hamming matching, RANSAC homography estimation and ECC refinement.

Copyright the OpenCV team and contributors — <https://opencv.org>.

