Copyright the lensfun project and its contributors — <https://lensfun.github.io>.
About 1,450 lenses, with their measured distortion and vignetting calibrations.
Orion reads the XML directly and does **not** link the lensfun library, so the
library's LGPL does not apply here; the data's CC BY-SA does.

⚠ **Share-alike binds the data, not Orion.** CC BY-SA 3.0 covers the database
